{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "A-All right... Just gotta do it...": "",
  "Excuse me, sir. Do you have a moment?": "",
  "Y-You thug! Give me back my Yusuke!": "",
  "Wait... Let's not jump to any conclusions. I'm not yakuza.": "",
  "You're not!? I thought you might have been the one who took him...": "",
  "Are you Yusuke-kun's father?": "",
  "Yes. I'm Shintaro Okabayashi.": "",
  "I'm Yagami, a private investigator. My associate prevented Yusuke-kun from getting kidnapped earlier.": "",
  "He did!? Then Yusuke is safe!? That's a huge relief!": "",
  "Care to tell me what's going on, though? Why are the yakuza after you two?": "",
  "Debts. They've been on me for a while now...": "",
  "Debt? I can understand them hounding you for money...": "",
  "But why are they resorting to kidnapping your son over it?": "",
  "They're trying to intimidate me. They probably wanted to exchange Yusuke for my lottery ticket...": "",
  "A lottery ticket? Why?": "",
  "Because it's a winning ticket. I actually won.": "",
  "They know they'd need a pretty convincing argument to make me give it to those bloodhounds, though.": "",
  "How much did you win?": "",
  "...50 million.": "",
  "Wha!? 50 mil!?": "",
  "I'm only about a million in the hole, and they want a ticket worth 50!": "",
  "Of course I refused, but then they escalated to threats. They said they'd kill Yusuke if I didn't give it to them.": "",
  "I got worried when I couldn't find him at the house, so I came down here to uh... settle it.": "",
  "I see. I understand now.": "",
  "But where is the lottery ticket now?": "",
  "Sorry, but there's no way I'm telling you that.": "",
  "Oh. Understandable.": "",
  "Can I ask where Yusuke is, then?": "",
  "Yusuke-kun is at a park nearby. I'll take you there.": "",
  "(He doesn't match the description... He's probably not Yusuke's father.)": "",
  "Yusuke! Where are you!?": "",
  "Kaito-san, what happened?": "",
  "I had to take a piss, and while I was gone, Yusuke disappeared...": "",
  "Did you see anyone suspicious around?": "",
  "No, but I did hear a scream... I hope it wasn't the kid...": "",
  "Damn. He probably got kidnapped.": "",
  "No. Yusuke...": "",
  "...I'm sorry. This is my fault.": "",
  "...! Oh no!": "",
  "Y-Yusuke!? Are you all right!?": "",
  "(Did the kidnappers call him!?)": "",
  "O-Okay. All right! Just don't you lay a hand on Yusuke!": "",
  "What'd they say, Okabayashi-san?": "",
  "They told me to come to the alleyway in the Champion District with the lottery ticket...": "",
  "And to not contact the police.": "",
  "This is a hostage situation now. We better be careful with our next step.": "",
  "Maybe there's a way to outsmart them... But how?": "",
  "Yo, Tak. I've got an idea, I think. A Kaito special.": "",
  "You're gonna have to get into character...": "",
  "(What are you cooking up, Kaito-san?)": "",
  "I-Is everything okay?": "",
  "Don't worry. If things go south, your son's safety will be my first priority.": "",
  "Hold on, Yusuke. We're coming, little buddy.": "",
  "Y-Yusuke!": "",
  "Dad!": "",
  "First things first. Did you call the cops?": "",
  "N-No. I didn't.": "",
  "Good. Hand over the ticket, then.": "",
  "And if you value your kid's life... no funny business. Got it?": "",
  "Ergh...!": "",
  "My dad says you yakuza guys are bad!": "",
  "And you know what happens to bad guys? Captain Cop comes and beats them up!": "",
  "Hey, what's this little brat going on about?": "",
  "Hell if I know.": "",
  "Captain Cop! I knew you'd show up!": "",
  "Shit! Everything's f-fucked! *hiccup*": "",
  "Calm down, Kaito-san. You'll win one of these days.": "",
  "W-Who the hell are you guys!?": "",
  "Eh? Can't you see I've gotta take a piss!? Or are ya into that kinda thing!? *hic*": "",
  "We're in the middle of somethin' here!? Go find a gutter to lie in, ya drunk!": "",
  "The hell you say!? You own this street or somethin'!? I don't think so!": "",
  "I just dropped 30k on lottery tickets, and they were all duds! *hic* I got every right to be mad!": "",
  "What the hell are you goin' on about!? You wanna die that bad!?": "",
  "(I'm kinda impressed this half-baked plan of his worked...)": "",
  "(But... I've gotta wonder if he planned on fighting them this whole time...)": "",
  "Gugh!": "",
  "You fuckin' drunk! Knock this fool out, boys!": "",
  "Heh, you really wanna be my punching bags!? This is gonna hurt like hell!": "",
  "Gooo! Get 'em, Captain Cop!": "",
  "What the fuck...!?": "",
  "Woooooooow! I knew he was the real Captain Cop!": "",
  "Yakuza suck!": "",
  "What the hell are you guys!?": "",
  "Nobody special. Just...": "",
  "A passing crime fighter.": "",
  "Thank you, you two! Thank you so much!": "",
  "Hey, I'm glad Yusuke's safe and all, but did the lottery ticket make it through that okay?": "",
  "Of course. Can you lend me the Captain Cop transformation stick for a second, Yusuke?": "",
  "Huh? Sure...": "",
  "That's where you had it!?": "",
  "I knew they'd ransack my house to find it, so I put it in the one thing that never leaves my son's hand...": "",
  "Hey, mister.": "",
  "Hm? What, kid?": "",
  "When are you gonna do the transformation pose!?": "",
  "Huh!? That again!?": "",
  "But you're real! You beat up all the bad yakuza!": "",
  "He's not going to let you leave until you do it, Kaito-san.": "",
  "B-But...": "",
  "Please, mister!": "",
  "Okay, but just this once, okay?": "",
  "...Nice.": "",
  "Wooooooooow! Captain Cop is real! He's the coolest!": "",
  "Tch. You think so, kid?": "",
  "I hope I grow up to be cool too, mister!": "",
  "Yeah, give it your best shot, kid. I'm pretty tough to beat.": "",
  "And then, and then... I'm going to fight bad yakuza with you!": "",
  "Eh? Say what!?": "",
  "Haha... Yeah, Kaito-san. Don't you have some streets to clean up?": "",
  "C'mon, Yusuke! Don't grow up to be like me!": "",
  "Forget it. I'm not cool! You don't wanna be like me.": "",
  "Huh? Why not!? I wanna fight together!": "",
  "Nah. I can't fight the yakuza. For... reasons.": "",
  "Why not!? Aren't you Captain Cop!?": "",
  "Yeah... Um...": "",
  "As of today, I'm retiring.": "",
  "Huh!? Why!?": "",
  "That's, uh... because...": "",
  "I've found a worthy successor.": "",
  "Yusuke, you were really brave today, you know that? You didn't even cry during all the scary stuff.": "",
  "You're gonna make a great crime fighter, Yusuke. A real hero of justice.": "",
  "Me? You mean it!?": "",
  "Yeah, and I think you could do even better than me. So grow up strong, kid.": "",
  "O-Okay! I'll do my best!": "",
  "(Looks like you got to be a real hero today, Kaito-san.)": "",
  "(A silver bat...)": "",
  "(The yakuza must have been wielding this when they tried to kidnap Yusuke.)": "",
  "(There's nothing out of the ordinary about it though, so it doesn't tell me much...)": "",
  "O-Oh. A knife...": "",
  "The guys trying to kidnap Yusuke must have gotten pretty serious.": "",
  "But pulling a knife on Kaito seems to have been a bad idea.": "",
  "Hmm. Not much chance of getting fingerprints off it, so I guess it doesn't help me much.": "",
  "Hm? Are these... steel knuckles?": "",
  "These won't tell me who owned them, though.": "",
  "There must be more to find, then.": "",
  "There's something under that crate.": "",
  "Hey! This is...": "",
  "Pocket tissues... Used? Gross.": "",
  "Hm? An ad.": "",
  "Yakumaru Loans, huh?": "",
  "...I'm reading this right, aren't I?": "",
  "Wouldn't be much of a stretch to tie a bunch of yakuza to loan sharking...": "",
  "Guess this might be a clue.": "",
  "Nothing, huh? I thought they might have been yakuza related.": "",
  "Yeah, but the problem is figuring out where they're based.": "",
  "(If Yakumaru Loans are just a bunch of sharks... I should head into similar waters.)": "",
  "(This place is closed.)": "",
  "(That guy was being harassed by debt collectors.)": "",
  "(Maybe he'd be willing to talk if I help him out.)": "",
  "Kamaguchi-san. A moment of your time?": "",
  "Hm? Yagami-san, what's going on?": "",
  "Does the name \"Yakumaru Loans\" ring any bells, by chance?": "",
  "I'm hoping I can find an office they do business out of.": "",
  "You wanna find Yakumaru Loans? Talk about bad news...": "",
  "So you do know them. Any idea where I can find them?": "",
  "You're on your own on that one. I don't really want to get involved.": "",
  "If they trace it back to us, we'd be in big trouble.": "",
  "I wouldn't let that happen...": "",
  "Fine. On one condition, though.": "",
  "Remember when I asked you to collect on a Keihin leader?": "",
  "I'll look into Yakumaru if you do that.": "",
  "I'm kind of in a hurry here...": "",
  "How about 50,000 for that info, then? That might convince me it's worth looking into them.": "",
  "Eh? You're charging me?": "",
  "You're damn right. Information has value, you know. And this info concerns Yakumaru.": "",
  "And if it concerns those guys, it has its risks. I need to be compensated, and 50k is a bargain.": "",
  "...I'll give it some thought.": "",
  "Hey, about Yakumaru Loans...": "",
  "What about them? Have you collected that cash from the Keihin Gang boys yet?": "",
  "Or would you rather pay 50k for it?": "",
  "Okay. I'll pay you, just get me that info, quick as you can.": "",
  "Pleasure doing business. Give me a few.": "",
  "(Oh, I don't have 50k...)": "",
  "Sorry. I'll come back later.": "",
  "I'll be here if you change your mind.": "",
  "I don't think I can pay 50k.": "",
  "(What should I do? Pay for the info or collect on the Keihin?)": "",
  "Just so you know, I'd usually charge about 50k for this kind of info...": "",
  "What!? 50k!?": "",
  "But since you're the one doing the asking, this one's on the house, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Oh, that's a relief!": "",
  "Give me a quick sec.": "",
  "Got it. The Ushimata Family is behind Yakumaru Loans. They're on East Taihei Boulevard.": "",
  "Nice. Thanks!": "",
  "Don't go thanking me yet. I couldn't tell you where on that street the office is.": "",
  "That's okay, it's a start. I should be able to figure it out.": "",
  "...Be careful, Yagami-san.": "",
  "(East Taihei Boulevard, huh? Guess I better head over.)": "",
  "(That guy's pretty suspicious, and he matches the description Yusuke-kun gave me. Let's have a chat.)": "",
  "He sure made a mess of things, though. Wonder if anything's underneath something else?": "",
  "I better give it a closer look.": "",
  "I don't think the yakuza even considered the possibility that Yusuke-kun might have the ticket.": "",
  "(There was a big money lending company on Tenkaichi Street...)": "",
  "Cop!": "",
  "(I might be able to find a clue lying around here somewhere...)": "",
  "Only way to do it is probably to track them down when they're in the area.": "",
  "(Hm, hey, there's Kaito-san. Looks like he's with someone he knows.)": "",
  "Hey, Kaito-san. This a friend of yours?": "",
  "Oh, hey, Tak. This is Adachi. He and I go all the way back to middle school.": "",
  "Adachi, this is Tak Yagami, the guy I've been telling you about.": "",
  "Oh, the man himself! Kaito never shuts up about you. I'm Hayato Adachi.": "",
  "Adachi Estate President and Director? I take it you own the company?": "",
  "Yeah, but it's still pretty small.": "",
  "We hadn't talked in years, but we ended up randomly crossing paths the other day.": "",
  "Now I've got a new drinking buddy. I'd meant to introduce you earlier, but, you know.": "",
  "The more the merrier, I say!": "",
  "Right now? This is all so sudden.": "",
  "Come on, jackass. We're going to Tender.": "",
  "Adachi here was one of the smartest kids in the school, you know? Even back then.": "",
  "So you were an honor student, huh?": "",
  "Nahhh, he's blowing it out of proportion.": "",
  "I tested well, but I was also a little punk, always picking fights. The teachers hated me.": "",
  "Haha. And that's the story of how we started getting along.": "",
  "Adachi and I were always teaming up to kick some neighborhood's wanna-be gang's asses.": "",
  "He was the brain, I was the brawn. We were a helluva tag team, right?": "",
  "Yeah, scary alone, unstoppable together. When you and I hit the streets together, it was bad news.": "",
  "To this day, I don't think I've ever met a guy I'd rather have on my team than Kaito-san.": "",
  "Ha, it's nice to be appreciated, but no need to lay it on <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> thick.": "",
  "Aw, it's fine. Besides, you've got a new partner now.": "",
  "You mean me?": "",
  "Ha! Tak? My partner? We're a pretty good team, but... partners? Whaddaya think, Tak?": "",
  "I dunno, I always thought of you as a colleague, but I guess \"partner\" works too.": "",
  "Hm.": "",
  "Yagami-san... I hate to ask this out of the blue, but do you think I could borrow Kaito for a bit?": "",
  "Oh, some kind of job thing?": "",
  "Exactly. I was going to visit you at your office to ask this, but...": "",
  "What's all this about, Adachi?": "",
  "Nah, here's fine. But what does a real estate firm need a lug like Kaito around for? Ha.": "",
  "Yeah, likely story. Get lost already.": "",
  "(And there's Kaito-san doing what he does best.)": "",
  "Is that guy in the loud shirt yakuza or something?": "",
  "Probably. Adachi is shady as hell. Wouldn't surprise me in the slightest if he was hiring yakuza.": "",
  "What do you mean, shady?": "",
  "You haven't heard the rumors? I've heard every negotiation his office gets involved with ends in threats.": "",
  "(Yikes. I can't just ignore a rumor like that.)": "",
  "Yo, Tak. What's up?": "",
  "Were those two guys talking shit?": "",
  "They just didn't like your shirt. Anyway, how's the job going, Kaito-san? Staying out of trouble?": "",
  "Hm? Now why would you ask that? Unless you think I'm the one <font_kind=yakuza_italic>causing</font_kind> trouble?": "",
  "No, no. I was just hearing rumors...": "",
  "I think that's a wrap for today, Kaito. What do you say we grab beers?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san? You should have told me you'd be stopping by.": "",
  "C'mon, Kaito. Tender sound good?": "",
  "Yeah, I just wanna grab a bite first. I'm starving.": "",
  "(That rumor I heard is going to keep bugging me.)": "",
  "(It's probably nothing, but I think I should look into it.)": "",
  "Hey, barkeep. You been seeing a lot of Kaito-san lately?": "",
  "Yeah, he's got a new buddy, it looks like.": "",
  "Right, the two of them go way back. The guy's name is Adachi.": "",
  "He runs a real estate business... Adachi Estate.": "",
  "Wait, Adachi Estate? You certain that's the same guy?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Dad!": "พ่อ!",
  "Ergh...!": "อึก...!",
  "Hell if I know.": "ใครจะไปรู้",
  "B-But...": "แ-แต่ว่า...",
  "Hm.": "หืม"
 }
}
